  "_comment": "Real Indian news sources ingested by the Bharat Wire news wire. Each item links back to the publisher; only headline, standfirst, image reference and publication time are stored. \"county\" here holds a state/UT name — the field name is kept for compatibility with the rest of the codebase. \"language\" is an ISO 639-1 code; every feed URL below was verified live (fetched and checked for real RSS content, including a native-script headline for the non-English ones) before being added — none are guessed. Every state/UT has at least one explicitly \"county\"-tagged Local source except Dadra and Nagar Haveli and Daman and Diu, for which no major outlet runs a dedicated feed (checked, not guessed) — stories about it still surface there via place-name detection in NewsWire::normalise(). A story can also pick up a county purely from its own text (see Locations::infer()), so a national or regional-language source can still show up on a state page without being tagged here.",
